# Logs
logs
*.log

# Rust analyzer
# We no longer use the .rust-analzyer folder as RA's target. We instead make use
# of `target/rust-analyzer` because it is included when we run `cargo clean`.
.rust-analyzer/

.aider*
*.pending-snap

